{
  "name": "Volleyball & Flag Race Team Championship",
  "description": "Template for co-ed volleyball and flag race championships with team registration",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "created": "2026-09-27",
  "updated": "2026-10-05",
  "sportConfig": {
    "gender": "ANY",
    "sports": ["VOLLEYBALL", "FLAG_RACE"],
    "minAge": 6,
    "maxAge": 12,
    "requireBothSports": true,
    "requireCompleteRosters": true,
    "requireGuardianConsent": true,
    "dualParticipationAllowed": true,
    "rosters": {
      "VOLLEYBALL": {
        "minRoster": 10,
        "maxRoster": 20,
        "activeCount": 12,
        "orderRequired": false,
        "substitutesAllowed": true
      },
      "FLAG_RACE": {
        "minRoster": 5,
        "maxRoster": 10,
        "activeCount": 10,
        "orderRequired": true,
        "substitutesAllowed": false
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "Co-ed is expressed as gender ANY; per-gender minimums (5 male + 5 female) are NOT enforceable by the current sportConfig schema (web/src/lib/registration/sport-config.ts) - gender is collected per participant and total roster bounds are enforced, but a hard per-gender split needs a validation extension.",
    "v1.0.0 carried an invalid gender CO_ED and non-schema keys (genderSplit, coaches) which threw SportConfigError on the live /giesm route; do not reintroduce them. The apply script now pre-validates."
  ],
  "fields": {
    "submission": [
      { "key": "headCoachName", "label": "Head Coach Name", "type": "TEXT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 1 },
      { "key": "headCoachEmail", "label": "Head Coach Email", "type": "EMAIL", "required": true, "sortOrder": 2 },
      { "key": "headCoachPhone", "label": "Head Coach Phone", "type": "PHONE", "required": true, "sortOrder": 3 },
      { "key": "assistantCoachName", "label": "Assistant Coach Name", "type": "TEXT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 4 },
      { "key": "assistantCoachEmail", "label": "Assistant Coach Email", "type": "EMAIL", "required": false, "sortOrder": 5 },
      { "key": "assistantCoachPhone", "label": "Assistant Coach Phone", "type": "PHONE", "required": false, "sortOrder": 6 },
      { "key": "teamName", "label": "Team Name", "type": "TEXT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 10 }
    ],
    "participant": {
      "VOLLEYBALL": [
        { "key": "volleyball_playerName", "label": "Player Name (Volleyball)", "type": "TEXT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 20 },
        { "key": "volleyball_jerseyNumber", "label": "Jersey Number (Volleyball)", "type": "TEXT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 21 },
        { "key": "volleyball_email", "label": "Email (Volleyball)", "type": "EMAIL", "required": true, "sortOrder": 22 },
        { "key": "volleyball_phone", "label": "Phone Number (Volleyball)", "type": "PHONE", "required": true, "sortOrder": 23 },
        { "key": "volleyball_gender", "label": "Gender (Volleyball)", "type": "SELECT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 24, "options": { "choices": ["MALE", "FEMALE"] } },
        { "key": "volleyball_dateOfBirth", "label": "Date of Birth (Volleyball)", "type": "DATE", "required": true, "sortOrder": 25 }
      ],
      "FLAG_RACE": [
        { "key": "flagrace_playerName", "label": "Player Name (Flag Race)", "type": "TEXT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 30 },
        { "key": "flagrace_email", "label": "Email (Flag Race)", "type": "EMAIL", "required": true, "sortOrder": 31 },
        { "key": "flagrace_phone", "label": "Phone Number (Flag Race)", "type": "PHONE", "required": true, "sortOrder": 32 },
        { "key": "flagrace_gender", "label": "Gender (Flag Race)", "type": "SELECT", "required": true, "sortOrder": 33, "options": { "choices": ["MALE", "FEMALE"] } },
        { "key": "flagrace_dateOfBirth", "label": "Date of Birth (Flag Race)", "type": "DATE", "required": true, "sortOrder": 34 }
      ]
    }
  },
  "defaultSettings": {
    "registrationWindow": { "daysBeforeEvent": 18, "durationDays": 14 },
    "shortLink": {
      "note": "Ad-friendly root URLs are first-class routes: add an entry to web/src/lib/public-short-links.ts AND a page at web/src/app/<slug>/page.tsx (see giesm).",
      "giesm": { "organizationSlug": "neon-ultra", "eventSlug": "giesm" }
    },
    "venue": {
      "name": "Indoor Hall, National Stadium Surulere",
      "address": "National Stadium, Surulere, Lagos",
      "city": "Lagos",
      "capacity": 5000
    }
  },
  "usage": {
    "description": "Apply with: npx tsx scripts/apply-registration-template.ts <eventId> data/templates/volleyball-flagrace-championship.json (pre-validates sportConfig). Then set event dates/venue, registration opensAt/closesAt, and enable the form.",
    "notes": [
      "gender MUST be FEMALE, MALE, or ANY (schema-validated); co-ed = ANY.",
      "Per-gender roster minimums are not enforceable by sportConfig; the gender field is collected per participant.",
      "Volleyball requires jersey numbers; flag race requires roster order."
    ]
  }
}
